00:03:52.428 --> 00:03:53.720
KEVIN NELSON: Hi, Kevin Nelson.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:57.150
I'm a developer advocate
based down in Los Angeles.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.090
